==Trivia==
*Special Enemies have fixed levels and do not scale with player's [[SOL-3 Phase|SOL Phase]].
*Successful [[Dodge#Dodge_Counter|Dodge Counters]] deal a fixed amount of [[damage]] to these enemies. This damage does not scale with character [[Attributes|stats]] nor player [[Union Level]].